1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
In a lush, shadowed jungle, giant ferns and broad, red-tipped leaves frame a misty valley. A wide waterfall cascades down a rocky cliff into a calm, glowing green river.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Thick sunbeams pierce the dense canopy, illuminating the heavy mist. High above, a brilliant point of light drops from the sky.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,245
The colony ship descends on a bright trail, crossing the sunbeams and sinking into the deep vegetation near the falls.
